  "details": "Allow Groups to invite other groups to their instances as a way to collab.\n\nHow this could Work:\n\nOne main group has a group instances.\n\nThis group can invite or be requested by another group to participate.\n\nWhat this would do is have the group instance be shown in the guest group's Instance. Thus, allowing groups to collaborate together in a single event without the need for everyone joining off friends. Because currently, If a group collabs with another, the members of the groups have to friend the event host and join that way, which gets more problematic the bigger the group gets.\n\nThis could also be extended to Events, where other groups could display a group's events in their own group, similar to how featured events are shared with everyone, only this would only appear to those in all collaborating groups and their groups events page.",
